[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:Please Send Me a Card]
[00:00.78]How many cards did the writer send? | 作者寄了多少张明信片？
[00:15.22]Postcards always spoil my holidays. | 明信片总是破坏我的假期。
[00:20.48]Last summer, I went to Italy. | 去年夏天，我去了意大利。
[00:23.90]I visited museums and sat in public gardens. | 我参观了博物馆，并坐在公共花园里。
[00:28.66]A friendly waiter taught me a few words of Italian. | 一位友好的服务员教了我几句意大利语。
[00:33.06]Then he lent me a book. | 然后他借给我一本书。
[00:35.69]I read a few lines, but I did not understand a word. | 我读了几行，但一个字也看不懂。
[00:41.26]Everyday I thought about postcards. | 每天我都想着明信片。
[00:45.74]My holidays passed quickly, | 我的假期过得很快，
[00:48.59]but I did not send cards to my friends. | 但我没有给朋友们寄明信片。
[00:52.46]On the last day I made a big decision. | 在最后一天，我做了一个重大决定。
[00:57.12]I got up early and bought thirty-seven cards. | 我起得很早，买了三十七张明信片。
[01:02.65]I spent the whole day in my room, | 我在房间里待了一整天，
[01:06.28]but I did not write a single card! | 但我一张明信片也没写！